"Replace this device's current Tailscale authentication state with this file? "
"The Tailscale settings saved on this router will be applied. If \"Tailscale "
"Enabled\" is off, the service will remain stopped. Do not use the same "
"Tailscale state file on two devices at once."
msgstr ""
"是否使用此文件替换本设备当前的 Tailscale 认证状态？此路由器上保存的 "
"Tailscale 设置将被应用。如果“启用 Tailscale”选项处于关闭状态，服务将保持停"
"止。请勿在两台设备上同时使用同一个 Tailscale 状态文件"

